83	/// The last attempt failed — covers all 3 failure rows of the I/O matrix:
84	/// - Mic permission denied -> [path]/[durationSeconds] both `null` ("No
85	///   file to preserve"); [AudioEntryCubit.retry] re-requests permission.
86	/// - Transcription failed -> [path]/[durationSeconds] carry the preserved
87	///   file; [AudioEntryCubit.retry] re-transcribes it, never re-records.
88	/// - Save failed (incl. offline) -> same preserved [path]/
89	///   [durationSeconds]/[text] semantics as `TextEntryError`; the modal's
